1
00:00:00,726 --> 00:00:02,646
(Raj:)Wait, my laptop.

2
00:00:02,811 --> 00:00:04,141
[HOWARD SIGHS]

3
00:00:13,697 --> 00:00:16,907
Yeah, there's a point
when this becomes idiotic.

4
00:00:17,075 --> 00:00:20,455
(Leonard:)And it wasn't
when we were driving like this?

5
00:00:21,246 --> 00:00:24,336
(Sheldon:)I would advise the three of you
that resistance is futile.

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,130
(Sheldon:)I have endless patience.

7
00:00:26,293 --> 00:00:30,083
I spent two and a half hours on hold
with Hewlett-Packard customer service...

8
00:00:30,255 --> 00:00:33,505
(Sheldon:)...just to complain
about their customer service.

9
00:00:35,052 --> 00:00:36,972
LEONARD:
You wanna talk about endless patience?

10
00:00:37,137 --> 00:00:41,267
(Leonard:)Penny made me watch all five seasons
of Sex and the City.

11
00:00:43,602 --> 00:00:45,142
RAJESH:
There's six seasons, dude.

12
00:00:45,312 --> 00:00:47,562
LEONARD:
Oh, crap.

13
00:00:48,899 --> 00:00:51,149
(Raj:)No, no, no, the sixth season is great.

14
00:00:51,318 --> 00:00:55,108
(Raj:)We go to Paris with Carrie
and get our heart broken...

15
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:59,030
(Raj:)...and then Mr. Big shows up.
We don't know if we can trust him again.

